      <p class="section-kicker"><span>04</span> ABOUT</p>
      <h2 id="about-title">About me.</h2>
      <p>I’m Lot, an Information Systems student at BYU based in Orem, Utah. I’m interested in product management and tech startups—understanding a problem, building something useful, and improving it through feedback.</p>
      <p>I’ve worked on projects ranging from games to custom websites. My experience in business development, customer support, and teaching helps me connect technical work with what people need.</p>
      <p>Outside work, I enjoy snowboarding, dirt biking, and time outdoors with my wife, friends, and family. I also served a two-year mission in the Philippines, learned Tagalog, and am a member of The Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints.</p>
